    {
        "text": "What happened to Babel? Any Sarkaz in contact with Her Majesty Theresa at the time would've asked this question."
    },
    {
        "text": "W definitely saw the truth, but she said nothing during the long journey."
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't ask, and neither did Ines. But, I think she's closer to the truth than I am."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before I knew it, I found myself trailing behind everyone else."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
