        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guys, it looks like we'll be stationed here for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The scouts spotted a Catastrophe brewing, with no Catastrophe Messengers nearby. We should stay as far away as possible, just in case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't risk it, no matter what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...A Catastrophe, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's rare to see one raging in the wilderness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we have plenty of experience dealing with Originium in Kazdel, so no need to panic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Where's W?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's with her team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Need her for something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... not sure. She's changed a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think her personality would change that much just because Theresa is gone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's too calm. It's unlike her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when we found her on the battlefield earlier, she still had that cynical, sarcastic expression.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If anything, she's only gotten worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's odd. I never thought you'd be perceptive enough to pick up on these subtle warning signs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Save the jabs. If W's being quiet, that warning sign's far from 'subtle.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "W, she... Oh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_thundercloud",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, the clouds are converging on the other side of the mountain, and the air pressure has changed drastically... Is that a Catastrophe cloud?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It might not be safe to station here given the size of that thing. Notify all our forces to retreat 50 kilometers along our original route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Find W, and make it quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't take orders from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, the feeling W gives off now... is just like that thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_laccolith",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro",
        "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "W! What are you doing\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wind\u2014 is so strong here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm enjoying the Catastrophe, what else?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you insane\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What'd you say? I\u2014 can't\u2014 hear\u2014 you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... I forgot you were always a lunatic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get the Sarkaz on your team killed with you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I already told them to evacuate with Hoederer. I'm not stupid\u2014 Hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "W! I'm telling you, be careful! Damn it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who should stay back. You're not gonna make it if you fall down there\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you think you will? If you don't want to die, get your ass back here\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_laccolith",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What the hell are you two doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ask her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She insists on clinging to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fortunately, we didn't lose anyone from W's team. Otherwise, we'd get court-martialed long before we get to join Reuinon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's all head back and rest first, then wait for the news.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong with fighting during a Catastrophe? Are you afraid of the storm? Or of Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_052",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd just rather not die an early death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get ourselves ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be a real special experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_laccolith",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? I'm not upset. It's not like we're a couple of ornery kids you have to break apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can say... that W did a good job taking care of her team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rare to hear you say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Say what? ...I have no idea if she's just a lunatic, or if she's... Goddamnit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's no damn storm cloud. She is the Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Swears*...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_laccolith",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahaha~!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're in a good mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's some news, but you don't get to hear it until we're out of this trash heap of a country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That can't be why you set our rendezvous point right under a Catastrophe, right...? Are you trying to get me killed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, don't put it that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what the biggest perk of being a lunatic is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure I want to know. But, I already have a pretty good idea just from following you, boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's this. The crazier shit you do, the less others question you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Rhodes Island' already left Kazdel, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be specific, we don't have any reports of a landship that big getting taken in by His Ma... by Theresis's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, so we do have a lead after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "We have more and more fresh faces on the team, but I feel better, knowing that I left Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Among those traveling with me are both friends and enemies, but it's always been volatile like that."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mercenaries don't care too much about the past because for our kind, life and death are easy come, easy go."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe because the war ended too quickly, we immediately plunged first into the next battle without ever tasting a moment of peace."
    },
    {
